## Experiment 5 — Remove a direction

```python
rng = np.random.default_rng(42)

embeddings = rng.normal(size=(100, 16))
direction = rng.normal(size=16)

direction = direction / np.linalg.norm(direction)

projection_coefficients = embeddings @ direction
cleaned_embeddings = (
    embeddings
    - projection_coefficients[:, None] * direction[None, :]
)

print(np.max(np.abs(cleaned_embeddings @ direction)))
```

The final value should be approximately zero.

